  "prefLabel": "En 2102.09 Non-affiliated energy competitor",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 2102.09 “Non-affiliated energy competitor” means any entity that is not an affiliate and that is engaged in the sale, brokering, or marketing of natural gas or electricity to retail customers, the development of an energy related generation, transmission, or distribution project, or the provision of related products or services.\n\nSource. #14519, eff 2-26-26, EXPIRES: 2-26-36",
